{"id":"n27821-1-7","stage":1,"title":"축구공 · 足球","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27821-1-7-1","ko":"민준아, 이마가 왜 그래? 다쳤어?","zh":"敏俊，你的额头怎么了？受伤了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"이마가","meaning":"额，前额，额头","explanation":"이마：额，前额，额头；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이마","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71693","senseId":"1","lemma":"이마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다쳤어?","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"772813c770d7cbf8","term":"이마","zh":"额，前额，额头","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3","entryId":"71693","definition":"指人脸眉毛以上、头发以下的部分。","pronunciation":["이마"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/33a9a229d58103605bd4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27821-1-7-2","ko":"어제 축구하다가 축구공에 맞았어.","zh":"昨天踢足球的时候被足球砸到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"축구하다가","meaning":"构筑，修建，修筑","explanation":"축구하다：构筑，修建，修筑；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"축구하다","audio":"/audio/f8b9ad2360b2e5468ce7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82171","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"축구공에","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구공：足球；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"축구공","audio":"/audio/73e76a4fd71d7fec835b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27821","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맞았어.","meaning":"打中，被打中","explanation":"맞다：打中，被打中；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66233","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"f8b9ad2360b2e546","term":"축구하다","zh":"构筑，修建，修筑","audio":"/audio/f8b9ad2360b2e5468ce7.mp3","entryId":"82171","definition":"将石头或泥土等堆砌起来建成城池或桥梁等。","pronunciation":["축꾸하다"]},{"id":"73e76a4fd71d7fec","term":"축구공","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/73e76a4fd71d7fec835b.mp3","entryId":"27821","definition":"足球运动使用的球。","pronunciation":["축꾸공"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"打中，被打中","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66233","definition":"射出或扔出的物体碰触到其它物体上；或被使得碰触到其它物体。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/868155c7fe375120755b.mp3",